{"id":"n71920-1-8","stage":3,"title":"의외 · 意外","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71920-1-8-1","ko":"주전들이 모두 빠진 시합에서 지다니.","zh":"居然输给了主力全都缺阵的对手。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"주전들이","meaning":"主力","explanation":"주전：主力；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"주전","audio":"/audio/466151385d412fada8d0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77066","senseId":"2","lemma":"주전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주전들이","audio":"/audio/6d3ad4128608a7e28594.mp3"}},{"text":"모두","meaning":"都，全","explanation":"모두：都，全","readings":[{"term":"모두","audio":"/audio/2576dfb09ecb81b98258.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28135","senseId":"1","lemma":"모두","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모두","audio":"/audio/2576dfb09ecb81b98258.mp3"}},{"text":"빠진","meaning":"缺席，不参加，退出，脱离","explanation":"빠지다：缺席，不参加，退出，脱离；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"빠지다","audio":"/audio/f1cb0821aeeaddd3adf4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66637","senseId":"8","lemma":"빠지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빠진","audio":"/audio/b6c9fd6d30bee578df08.mp3"}},{"text":"시합에서","meaning":"比赛","explanation":"시합：比赛；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"시합","audio":"/audio/944bf12d99b921ad200e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"13985","senseId":"1","lemma":"시합","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시합에서","audio":"/audio/c4f0919dbc9f2964824c.mp3"}},{"text":"지다니.","meaning":"输","explanation":"지다：输；다니：对听到的内容表示惊讶、感叹或反问。","readings":[{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63606","senseId":"1","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지다니","audio":"/audio/e0394a42e1ec7999d83c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"466151385d412fad","term":"주전","zh":"主力","audio":"/audio/466151385d412fada8d0.mp3","entryId":"77066","definition":"作为骨干参加比赛、打斗等；或指那样的人。","pronunciation"